{"PageNumber":448,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":37,"SurahIndex":"037","VerseNumber":52,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"يَقُولُ أَءِنَّكَ لَمِنَ ٱلۡمُصَدِّقِينَ","TajweedText":"يَقُولُ أَءِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َكَ لَمِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُصَدِّق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٢</span>","End":"٥٢","PageNumber":448,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":387,"MaqraNumber":179,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":37,"SurahIndex":"037","VerseNumber":53,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَءِذَا مِتۡنَا وَكُنَّا تُرَابٗا وَعِظَٰمًا أَءِنَّا لَمَدِينُونَ","TajweedText":"أَءِذَا مِتْنَا وَكُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا تُرَا<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>بًا و</tajweed>َعِظَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>مًا أَءِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا لَمَدِين<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٣</span>","End":"٥٣","PageNumber":448,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":387,"MaqraNumber":179,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":37,"SurahIndex":"037","VerseNumber":54,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ هَلۡ أَنتُم مُّطَّلِعُونَ","TajweedText":"قَالَ هَلْ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ُّطَّلِع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٤</span>","End":"٥٤","PageNumber":448,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":387,"MaqraNumber":179,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":37,"SurahIndex":"037","VerseNumber":55,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَٱطَّلَعَ فَرَءَاهُ فِي سَوَآءِ ٱلۡجَحِيمِ","TajweedText":"فَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>طَّلَعَ فَرَءَاهُ فِى سَو<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْجَح<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مِ <span class=end>٥٥</span>"